00:18.460 --> 00:21.300
I'm gonna knock the door

00:21.300 --> 00:24.870
into the world of perfect free

00:24.870 --> 00:26.970
(You ain't no lonely!)

00:26.970 --> 00:29.810
You're gonna say I'm lying

00:29.810 --> 00:32.540
I'm gonna get the chance

00:32.540 --> 00:36.110
I thought a chance is far from me

00:36.110 --> 00:37.280
(You ain't no lonely!)

00:37.280 --> 00:40.190
I was made to hit in America

