Saku!

01:42.750 --> 01:46.320
What's up, Koyuki?
You're excited this morning.

01:46.320 --> 01:48.950
It's been decided! The album!

01:48.950 --> 01:50.060
You mean-?

01:50.060 --> 01:52.760
Yup! Dying Breed's releasing a new album!

01:52.760 --> 01:53.960
Eh?!

01:53.960 --> 01:56.760
They're releasing their first single!

01:56.760 --> 01:59.130
I've got to buy it ASAP!

01:59.130 --> 02:01.360
Yeah, then can you loan it to me?

02:02.470 --> 02:03.740
Sure thing.

02:03.740 --> 02:05.600
Did you see last night's Best UK?

02:05.600 --> 02:07.810
Yeah, it was excellent!

02:07.810 --> 02:11.180
-His white shirt and yellow tie!
-That guy was so cool!

02:11.180 --> 02:11.280
Yeah!

02:11.280 --> 02:12.680
"Eve of the Live Show"

02:11.280 --> 02:12.680
Yeah!

02:12.680 --> 02:16.340
"Eve of the Live Show"

02:12.680 --> 02:16.340
Let's see...For the
200m individual medley...

02:16.340 --> 02:20.710
Yes. I nominate Yukio Tanaka.

02:20.710 --> 02:23.310
Huh? Tanaka-kun?

02:23.310 --> 02:29.790
Sensei! This swim meet commemorates
our school's 40th anniversary.

02:29.790 --> 02:36.060
For our class's honor, we should
aspire to our utmost formation.

02:36.060 --> 02:37.890
Yeah, right.

02:37.890 --> 02:40.430
That sounds incredibly lame.

02:40.430 --> 02:43.400
For sure...What a joke.

02:46.370 --> 02:49.540
But, Tanaka-kun...

02:49.540 --> 02:51.370
Is it all right?

02:51.370 --> 02:52.340
Well...

02:52.340 --> 02:54.510
He's fine with it.

02:54.510 --> 02:59.920
Tanaka-kun's been getting
expert lessons from some Saito creep.

02:59.920 --> 03:02.110
Who the heck is that?!

03:05.150 --> 03:07.140
Never heard of 'im!

03:09.290 --> 03:12.730
Then everyone, it's decided, okay?

03:12.730 --> 03:16.100
Umm, 100m Backstroke, Yukio Tanaka.

03:16.100 --> 03:19.630
50m Butterfly, Yukio Tanaka.

03:19.630 --> 03:26.200
200m Individual Medley,
Yukio Tanaka. 50m-

03:59.410 --> 04:01.710
-This is exciting!
-Yeah!

04:13.890 --> 04:20.930
Typhoon 24! 24-7! 24 hours straight!

04:20.930 --> 04:25.830
We're gonna rush at you!
Gonna send you flyin'!

04:25.830 --> 04:28.070
Lift up your heavy ass, now

04:28.070 --> 04:31.410
If you take off that stiff head
you'll feel totally loose

04:31.410 --> 04:33.070
This crazy, crazy world

04:33.070 --> 04:35.810
